   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Unlike  Mexicans in California and Texas after 1848, the elite residents of Tucson",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1169677,
     "content_html": "managed to maintain their economic and social status for a time"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169676,
     "content_html": "rapidly assimilated into U.S. culture"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169675,
     "content_html": "suffered rampant land loss and violence at the hands of Americans"
    },
    {
     "id": 1169674,
     "content_html": "enjoyed full civil and political rights from the outset of U.S. rule\n"
    }
